 "description": "A durable clock you can't build yourself: re-check a URL every N hours (min 1h) and get notified ONLY when it changes. Registered handle + secret required; \u22645 per handle; auto-expires in 14d, auto-pauses if idle 7d.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
